activity Submit Timesheet
activity Approve Timesheet
activity Calculate Gross Pay
activity Calculate Deductions
activity Calculate Net Pay
activity Generate Paystub
activity Process Payment
activity Update Payroll Records
activity Review Payroll Report
activity Distribute Paystub
bind Submit Timesheet: Employee ID, Hours Worked, Timesheet Status
bind Approve Timesheet: Employee ID, Timesheet Status
bind Calculate Gross Pay: Hours Worked, Pay Rate, Gross Pay
bind Calculate Deductions: Gross Pay, Tax Deduction, Insurance Deduction
bind Calculate Net Pay: Gross Pay, Tax Deduction, Insurance Deduction, Net Pay
bind Process Payment: Employee ID, Net Pay, Payment Method
Hours Worked: integer between 0 and 80
Pay Rate: float between 10.0 and 100.0
Gross Pay: float between 0.0 and 10000.0
Tax Deduction: float between 0.0 and 5000.0
Insurance Deduction: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Net Pay: float between 0.0 and 10000.0
Timesheet Status: Submitted, Approved, Rejected
Payment Method: Direct Deposit, Check
Employee ID: integer between 1000 and 9999
Init[Submit Timesheet] | |
End[Distribute Paystub] | |
Existence[Approve Timesheet] | |
Existence[Calculate Net Pay] | |
Absence2[Review Payroll Report] | |
Exactly[Calculate Gross Pay] | |
Responded Existence[Calculate Deductions, Calculate Net Pay] | | |
Precedence[Approve Timesheet, Submit Timesheet] | | |
Precedence[Calculate Gross Pay, Approve Timesheet] | |A.Timesheet Status is Approved |
Precedence[Process Payment, Calculate Net Pay] | | |
Response[Submit Timesheet, Approve Timesheet] |A.Timesheet Status is Submitted | |
Response[Calculate Net Pay, Generate Paystub] | | |
Response[Process Payment, Update Payroll Records] | | |
Succession[Calculate Gross Pay, Calculate Deductions] | | |
Succession[Update Payroll Records, Review Payroll Report] | | |
Alternate Response[Calculate Net Pay, Generate Paystub] | | |
Alternate Succession[Process Payment, Update Payroll Records] | | |
Chain Response[Calculate Gross Pay, Calculate Deductions] | | |
Chain Succession[Calculate Deductions, Calculate Net Pay] | | |
Co-Existence[Generate Paystub, Distribute Paystub] | | |
Choice[Calculate Net Pay, Process Payment] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Approve Timesheet, Calculate Gross Pay] | |A.Timesheet Status is Rejected |
Not Precedence[Distribute Paystub, Generate Paystub] | | |
Not Response[Update Payroll Records, Submit Timesheet] | | |
Not Succession[Distribute Paystub, Calculate Gross Pay] | | |
Not Chain Precedence[Calculate Net Pay, Submit Timesheet] | | |
Not Chain Response[Approve Timesheet, Generate Paystub] | | |
Not Chain Succession[Submit Timesheet, Process Payment] | | |